{"seq":3,"slug":"proposal-design","title":"提议分布设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/samplers/proposal-design","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"提议分布设计\">提议分布设计</h1><p>同一个 <a href=\"metropolis-hastings\">Metropolis-Hastings</a> 框架，提议分布换一换，链的效率能差出几个数量级。提议是 MH 里唯一你能自由设计的部件，也是「算法能跑」和「算法好用」之间的全部距离。这一篇集中讲提议设计的三层功夫：随机游走的步长权衡、自适应提议，以及借梯度信息的 Langevin 提议——后者正是通往哈密顿蒙特卡洛的桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>提议分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(x \\to y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定「从当前点往哪儿、走多远」试探下一个候选。设计它要同时顾两件相互拉扯的事：<strong>探索</strong>（步子要够大，才能在合理时间内走遍整个分布）和<strong>接受</strong>（步子不能太大，否则候选总落在低概率区被拒、原地空转）。这两者的张力浓缩成一个可观测的指标——<strong>接受率</strong>。接受率太高，说明步子太小、在原地磨蹭；太低，说明步子太大、几乎全被拒。好的提议设计就是把接受率调进一个甜区。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[选择提议步长] --&gt; B{观察接受率}&#10;  B --&gt;|接受率过高 ~0.9| C[步子太小&lt;br/&gt;探索慢, 自相关高]&#10;  B --&gt;|接受率过低 ~0.05| D[步子太大&lt;br/&gt;候选总被拒, 原地空转]&#10;  B --&gt;|落在甜区| E[探索与接受平衡&lt;br/&gt;混合最快]&#10;  C --&gt; F[加大步长]&#10;  D --&gt; G[减小步长]&#10;  F --&gt; B&#10;  G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[选择提议步长] --&gt; B{观察接受率}\n  B --&gt;|接受率过高 ~0.9| C[步子太小&lt;br/&gt;探索慢, 自相关高]\n  B --&gt;|接受率过低 ~0.05| D[步子太大&lt;br/&gt;候选总被拒, 原地空转]\n  B --&gt;|落在甜区| E[探索与接受平衡&lt;br/&gt;混合最快]\n  C --&gt; F[加大步长]\n  D --&gt; G[减小步长]\n  F --&gt; B\n  G --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"步长与接受率-那个-0-234-从哪来\">步长与接受率：那个 0.234 从哪来</h2><p>随机游走 Metropolis 用高斯提议 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x + \\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma^2 \\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，唯一旋钮是步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。理论分析（Roberts、Gelman、Gilks 1997）给出一个著名的渐近结论：对高维的光滑目标分布，<strong>最优接受率约为 0.234</strong>，此时链的效率（每步有效移动）最大。低维下这个最优值更高（一维约 0.44）。这意味着调参的实操目标很明确——监控接受率，逼近 0.234 附近：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测接受率</th>\n<th>诊断</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt; 0.6</td>\n<td>步子过小，链在原地颤动</td>\n<td>增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.2 – 0.4</td>\n<td>接近最优（高维取 ~0.234）</td>\n<td>维持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 0.1</td>\n<td>步子过大，候选频繁被拒</td>\n<td>减小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>但单一标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 假设各方向同性。当后验在不同方向尺度差异巨大、或参数高度相关时，球形提议怎么调都不对——这就要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2\\mathbf{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 换成贴合后验协方差的满矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span>，让提议沿后验的主轴拉伸。问题是后验协方差事先不知道，于是有了自适应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应提议-让链自己学步长\">自适应提议：让链自己学步长</h2><p><strong>自适应 MCMC</strong> 在采样过程中用已采到的样本估计后验协方差，动态更新提议的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span>（Haario 等的 Adaptive Metropolis 是代表）。直觉很顺：跑了一阵后，样本的经验协方差就近似后验协方差，拿它当提议尺度自然贴合。但自适应有个理论陷阱——<strong>边采样边改转移核会破坏马氏性</strong>，因为转移核依赖了全部历史而非仅当前状态，遍历定理不再直接适用。补救是「<strong>消失适应</strong>」（diminishing adaptation）：让适应的幅度随时间趋于零，后期转移核近似冻结，从而恢复收敛保证。实践中常用的折中是只在 warmup 阶段适应、采样阶段固定下来——这正是现代采样器（包括 NUTS）的标准做法，详见 <a href=\"../practice/mixing-tuning\">混合与调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"langevin-提议-让梯度指路\">Langevin 提议：让梯度指路</h2><p>前面的提议都「盲」：随机游走不知道哪边概率高，只能瞎试。<strong>Metropolis-adjusted Langevin algorithm（MALA）</strong> 把目标分布的对数梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla \\log \\pi(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 塞进提议，让候选朝高概率方向偏移：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x + \\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2}\\nabla \\log \\pi(x) + \\epsilon\\,\\mathcal{N}(0, \\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是「漂移」，把候选往概率密度上升的方向推；第二项是随机扰动维持探索。因为提议不再对称，要用完整的 Hastings 接受率修正。MALA 的最优接受率约 0.574，比随机游走高，且在高维下每步走得更有方向感、混合更快。它是「用一阶梯度信息提升提议」的最简形式，而把这个思路推到极致——用动量沿连续动力学轨迹走很多步——就得到 <a href=\"../modern/hamiltonian-monte-carlo\">哈密顿蒙特卡洛</a>。可以说 MALA 是 HMC 的单步特例，这一篇到此把读者交给现代方法章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三代提议的对照\">三代提议的对照</h2><p>把三种提议并排看，能看清「用多少目标分布的信息，换多少效率」这条主线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提议族</th>\n<th>提议形式</th>\n<th>用到的信息</th>\n<th>高维最优接受率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机游走 Metropolis</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x + \\mathcal{N}(0, \\sigma^2\\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅目标密度值</td>\n<td>~0.234</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Langevin（MALA）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x + \\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2}\\nabla\\log\\pi + \\epsilon\\,\\mathcal{N}(0,\\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一阶梯度</td>\n<td>~0.574</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈密顿（HMC）</td>\n<td>动量 + leapfrog 多步积分</td>\n<td>一阶梯度 + 动量</td>\n<td>target 常取 ~0.8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从 RWM 到 MALA 再到 HMC，每往上一级就多用一点分布几何的信息，允许的最优接受率随之抬高、每步走得更有效率。这条阶梯的顶端就是下一篇 <a href=\"../modern/hamiltonian-monte-carlo\">哈密顿蒙特卡洛</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>提议是 MH 里唯一可设计的部件，决定探索与接受的平衡，由接受率反映。</li>\n<li>随机游走的最优接受率高维约 0.234、一维约 0.44；监控它来调步长。</li>\n<li>各向异性或强相关后验需把球形提议换成贴合协方差的满矩阵。</li>\n<li>自适应 MCMC 用样本学提议尺度，但须靠消失适应或只在 warmup 适应来保收敛。</li>\n<li>Langevin 提议用对数梯度指路，混合更快，是通往哈密顿蒙特卡洛的桥。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"metropolis-hastings\">Metropolis-Hastings</a>——提议所嵌入的框架；<a href=\"../modern/hamiltonian-monte-carlo\">哈密顿蒙特卡洛</a>——把梯度提议推到极致；<a href=\"../practice/mixing-tuning\">混合与调优</a>——warmup 期的步长整定。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../optimization-theory/unconstrained-optimization/gradient-descent\">梯度下降</a> 与 Langevin 漂移项共享同一对数梯度直觉；<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/random-variables/continuous-distributions\">连续型分布</a> 是高斯提议的前置。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"提议分布设计","id":"提议分布设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"步长与接受率：那个 0.234 从哪来","id":"步长与接受率-那个-0-234-从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应提议：让链自己学步长","id":"自适应提议-让链自己学步长"},{"level":2,"text":"Langevin 提议：让梯度指路","id":"langevin-提议-让梯度指路"},{"level":2,"text":"三代提议的对照","id":"三代提议的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Gibbs 采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/samplers/gibbs-sampling"},"next":{"title":"哈密顿蒙特卡洛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/hamiltonian-monte-carlo"}}